  "notes": [
   "The restricted electives list also includes 'Any OCC Business Course A100 or higher', which is not recorded as a course entry; the closed-list BUS courses fall under it.",
   "The requirements table prints no units beside restricted elective courses or beside HORT A105, so those units are null. The Program Sequence tab prints units for these courses as 'Recommended Choices'. Most match the closed list, but HORT A200 is printed there as 1.5 (closed list 3) and HORT A286 as 1.5.",
   "HORT A200 and HORT A285 appear under both the Fall and Spring elective lists; each is recorded once.",
   "OCC AS General Education is printed as 'up to 21' units, so ge_units is left null. Footnote 3 says the Cal-GETC pattern (up to 34 units) may be substituted.",
   "Transferable electives are printed as 'varies' toward the 60-unit degree minimum, so electives_fill_degree is true. The Program Sequence total prints as 60-62.",
   "BIOL A183L is recorded as recommended from footnote 1 ('Transfer students should also take BIOL A183L Botany Lab.').",
   "Careers are taken from the Program Mission statement. The text opens mid-sentence ('...d sales, interior plantscaping, landscape design, and construction and maintenance.'), so possible career areas there are cut off and not recorded.",
